---
interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = 'es' } = Astro.props;
const isEs = lang === 'es';
---

<div class="pa-screen" data-presentation="punteros-y-arreglos-c" data-lang={lang}>
	<div class="pa-shell">
		<nav class="pa-nav" aria-label={isEs ? 'Controles de navegación' : 'Navigation controls'}>
			<button class="btn btn-secondary" id="paPrevBtn" aria-label={isEs ? 'Diapositiva anterior' : 'Previous slide'} disabled>
				<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
					<path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6" />
				</svg>
				<span>{isEs ? 'Anterior' : 'Previous'}</span>
			</button>

			<div class="pa-nav-center">
				<div class="pa-seg" role="radiogroup" aria-label={isEs ? 'Modo de estudio' : 'Study mode'}>
					<label class="pa-seg-opt">
						<input type="radio" name="paMode" value="learn" checked />
						<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
							<path d="M12 7v14" />
							<path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z" />
						</svg>
						<span>{isEs ? 'Aprender' : 'Learn'}</span>
					</label>
					<label class="pa-seg-opt">
						<input type="radio" name="paMode" value="practice" />
						<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
							<path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z" />
							<path d="m15 5 4 4" />
						</svg>
						<span>{isEs ? 'Practicar' : 'Practice'}</span>
					</label>
					<label class="pa-seg-opt">
						<input type="radio" name="paMode" value="assess" />
						<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
							<rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1" />
							<path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2" />
							<path d="m9 14 2 2 4-4" />
						</svg>
						<span>{isEs ? 'Evaluar' : 'Assess'}</span>
					</label>
				</div>
				<span class="pa-counter" id="paSlideCounter" aria-live="polite">1 / 8</span>
			</div>

			<button class="btn btn-secondary" id="paNextBtn" aria-label={isEs ? 'Siguiente diapositiva' : 'Next slide'}>
				<span>{isEs ? 'Siguiente' : 'Next'}</span>
				<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
					<path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6" />
				</svg>
			</button>
		</nav>

		<main class="pa-viewport">
			<!-- ═════════════ Learn mode ═════════════ -->
			<section class="pa-slide is-active" data-slide="1" data-mode="learn" data-item="0">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Aprender · 1' : 'Learn · 1'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Celdas contiguas y p + n' : 'Contiguous cells and p + n'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead">{isEs ? 'Los elementos de un arreglo están contiguos. Sumar 1 a un puntero lo lleva al siguiente elemento, no al siguiente byte: p + n avanza n * sizeof(*p) bytes.' : 'Array elements are contiguous. Adding 1 to a pointer takes it to the next element, not the next byte: p + n moves n * sizeof(*p) bytes.'}</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-stepper></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="2" data-mode="learn" data-item="1">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Aprender · 2' : 'Learn · 2'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'a[i] es *(a + i)' : 'a[i] is *(a + i)'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead">{isEs ? 'El nombre de un arreglo decae a un puntero a su primer elemento, y el operador [] está definido como aritmética de punteros más desreferenciación.' : 'An array name decays to a pointer to its first element, and the [] operator is defined as pointer arithmetic plus a dereference.'}</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-stepper></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="3" data-mode="learn" data-item="2">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Aprender · 3' : 'Learn · 3'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Pasar un arreglo es pasar un puntero' : 'Passing an array passes a pointer'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead">{isEs ? 'Al llamar a una función, el arreglo decae: viaja la dirección del primer elemento y sizeof deja de medir el arreglo. La longitud viaja aparte, como size_t.' : 'When you call a function, the array decays: the address of the first element travels and sizeof stops measuring the array. The length travels separately, as a size_t.'}</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-stepper></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="4" data-mode="learn" data-item="3">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Aprender · 4' : 'Learn · 4'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Restar punteros: ptrdiff_t' : 'Subtracting pointers: ptrdiff_t'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead">{isEs ? 'Restar dos punteros del mismo arreglo da la cantidad de elementos que los separa, de tipo ptrdiff_t, y se imprime con %td.' : 'Subtracting two pointers into the same array gives the number of elements between them, of type ptrdiff_t, printed with %td.'}</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-stepper></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="5" data-mode="learn" data-item="4">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Aprender · 5' : 'Learn · 5'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Una posición después del final' : 'One past the end'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead">{isEs ? 'Qué punteros se pueden calcular y cuáles se pueden desreferenciar. Salir del arreglo es comportamiento indefinido.' : 'Which pointers you may compute and which you may dereference. Leaving the array is undefined behavior.'}</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-stepper></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="6" data-mode="learn" data-item="5">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Aprender · 6' : 'Learn · 6'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Recorrer una cadena con char *' : 'Walking a string with a char *'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead">{isEs ? "Una cadena es un arreglo de char terminado en '\\0'. Como cualquier arreglo, decae a un char * que se avanza hasta encontrar el terminador." : "A string is a char array terminated by '\\0'. Like any array, it decays to a char * that you move forward until you find the terminator."}</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-stepper></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="7" data-mode="learn" data-item="6">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Aprender · 7' : 'Learn · 7'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Punteros a estructuras y ->' : 'Pointers to structs and ->'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead">{isEs ? 'En lugar de copiar una estructura, se pasa su dirección. p->campo es exactamente lo mismo que (*p).campo.' : 'Instead of copying a struct, you pass its address. p->member is exactly the same as (*p).member.'}</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-stepper></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="8" data-mode="learn" data-item="7">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Aprender · 8' : 'Learn · 8'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'int **, void * y punteros a funciones' : 'int **, void * and function pointers'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead">{isEs ? 'Un puntero que guarda la dirección de otro puntero, un puntero genérico que no se desreferencia sin convertirlo y un puntero que elige qué función llamar.' : 'A pointer that holds the address of another pointer, a generic pointer you cannot dereference without converting it, and a pointer that chooses which function to call.'}</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-stepper></div></div>
			</section>

			<!-- ═════════════ Practice mode ═════════════ -->
			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="9" data-mode="practice" data-item="0">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Practicar · 1' : 'Practice · 1'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Predice el siguiente estado' : 'Predict the next state'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead" data-q></p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-practice></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="10" data-mode="practice" data-item="1">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Practicar · 2' : 'Practice · 2'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Predice el siguiente estado' : 'Predict the next state'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead" data-q></p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-practice></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="11" data-mode="practice" data-item="2">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Practicar · 3' : 'Practice · 3'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Predice el siguiente estado' : 'Predict the next state'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead" data-q></p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-practice></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="12" data-mode="practice" data-item="3">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Practicar · 4' : 'Practice · 4'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Predice el siguiente estado' : 'Predict the next state'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead" data-q></p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-practice></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="13" data-mode="practice" data-item="4">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Practicar · 5' : 'Practice · 5'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Predice el siguiente estado' : 'Predict the next state'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead" data-q></p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-practice></div></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="14" data-mode="practice" data-item="5">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Practicar · 6' : 'Practice · 6'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Predice el siguiente estado' : 'Predict the next state'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead" data-q></p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card"><div data-lab></div><div data-practice></div></div>
			</section>

			<!-- ═════════════ Assess mode ═════════════ -->
			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="15" data-mode="assess" data-item="0">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Evaluar · 1 de 6' : 'Assess · 1 of 6'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title" data-q></h2>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card" data-assess></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="16" data-mode="assess" data-item="1">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Evaluar · 2 de 6' : 'Assess · 2 of 6'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title" data-q></h2>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card" data-assess></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="17" data-mode="assess" data-item="2">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Evaluar · 3 de 6' : 'Assess · 3 of 6'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title" data-q></h2>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card" data-assess></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="18" data-mode="assess" data-item="3">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Evaluar · 4 de 6' : 'Assess · 4 of 6'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title" data-q></h2>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card" data-assess></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="19" data-mode="assess" data-item="4">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Evaluar · 5 de 6' : 'Assess · 5 of 6'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title" data-q></h2>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card" data-assess></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="20" data-mode="assess" data-item="5">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Evaluar · 6 de 6' : 'Assess · 6 of 6'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title" data-q></h2>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card" data-assess></div>
			</section>

			<section class="pa-slide" data-slide="21" data-mode="assess" data-item="result">
				<div class="pa-head">
					<span class="kicker">{isEs ? 'Evaluar · resultado' : 'Assess · result'}</span>
					<h2 class="pa-title">{isEs ? 'Califica tus respuestas' : 'Grade your answers'}</h2>
					<p class="pa-lead">{isEs ? 'Cuando hayas respondido las seis preguntas, califícalas. Verás tu puntaje, la respuesta correcta de cada una y por qué.' : 'Once you have answered the six questions, grade them. You will see your score, the correct answer to each one and why.'}</p>
				</div>
				<div class="pa-card">
					<div class="pa-actions">
						<button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" id="paGradeBtn">{isEs ? 'Calificar' : 'Grade'}</button>
						<button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button" id="paRetryBtn">
							<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
								<path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8" />
								<path d="M3 3v5h5" />
							</svg>
							<span>{isEs ? 'Reintentar' : 'Try again'}</span>
						</button>
					</div>
					<p class="pa-score" id="paScore" aria-live="polite"></p>
					<ol class="pa-results" id="paResults"></ol>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	.pa-screen {
		min-height: calc(100dvh - var(--site-header-height, 0px));
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		background: var(--color-bg);
		color: var(--color-text);
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		--pa-cell: 5.5rem;
		--pa-gap: var(--space-2);
		--pa-row: 1.5rem;
	}

	.pa-shell {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: none;
		margin: 0;
		flex: 1;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.pa-viewport { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }

	@media (min-width: 1440px) { .pa-viewport { zoom: 1.08; } }
	@media (min-width: 1680px) { .pa-viewport { zoom: 1.16; } }
	@media (min-width: 1920px) { .pa-viewport { zoom: 1.25; } }

	.pa-viewport { flex: 1; }

	.pa-nav {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: var(--space-3);
		padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-6);
		background: var(--color-surface);
	}

	.pa-nav-center {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-4);
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	/* Segmented control, ported from Organic/styles.css (.seg / .seg-opt). */
	.pa-seg {
		display: inline-flex;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
		border-radius: 999px;
	}

	.pa-seg-opt {
		position: relative;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-1);
		padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.pa-seg-opt input {
		position: absolute;
		opacity: 0;
		width: 0;
		height: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.pa-seg-opt + .pa-seg-opt { border-left: 1px solid var(--color-divider); }
	.pa-seg-opt:has(input:checked) { background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-bg); }
	.pa-seg-opt:not(:has(input:checked)):hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 7%, transparent); }
	.pa-seg-opt:has(input:focus-visible) { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: -2px; }

	.pa-counter {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 55%, transparent);
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
	}

	.pa-slide {
		display: none;
		padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-8);
		max-width: 76rem;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.pa-slide.is-active {
		display: block;
		animation: paFade 0.25s ease-out;
	}

	@keyframes paFade {
		from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
		to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
	}

	.pa-head { margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }

	.pa-title {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight);
		font-size: 1.65rem;
		line-height: 1.2;
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
	}

	.pa-lead {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 75%, transparent);
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 72ch;
	}

	.pa-card {
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		padding: var(--space-6);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	/* — lab: code on the left, memory on the right — */
	.pa-lab {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		gap: var(--space-4);
	}

	@media (min-width: 1024px) {
		.pa-lab { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.95fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr); align-items: start; }
	}

	.pa-code {
		margin: 0;
		padding: var(--space-3) 0;
		background: var(--color-bg);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		overflow-x: auto;
	}

	.pa-line {
		display: block;
		padding: 0 var(--space-3);
		border-left: 3px solid transparent;
		white-space: pre;
		min-height: 1.55em;
		transition: background 0.25s ease;
	}

	.pa-line-no {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 2.5ch;
		margin-right: var(--space-2);
		text-align: right;
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 40%, transparent);
		user-select: none;
	}

	.pa-line.is-current {
		background: var(--color-accent-100);
		border-left-color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.pa-machine {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-3);
		min-width: 0;
	}

	.pa-track {
		overflow-x: auto;
		padding-bottom: var(--space-2);
	}

	.pa-ptrs {
		position: relative;
		width: calc(var(--n, 1) * (var(--pa-cell) + var(--pa-gap)));
		height: calc(2.6rem + (var(--rows, 1) - 1) * var(--pa-row));
	}

	.pa-ptr {
		position: absolute;
		left: calc(var(--i, 0) * (var(--pa-cell) + var(--pa-gap)));
		bottom: calc(var(--row, 0) * var(--pa-row));
		width: var(--pa-cell);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		color: var(--color-accent-2-700);
		transition: left 0.6s ease, bottom 0.3s ease;
		animation: paFade 0.3s ease-out;
	}

	.pa-ptr-name {
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		padding: 0 var(--space-2);
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--color-accent-2-100);
		color: var(--color-accent-2-800);
		white-space: nowrap;
		line-height: 1.4rem;
	}

	.pa-ptr svg { width: 1.1rem; height: 1.1rem; }
	.pa-ptr:not([data-row="0"]) svg { visibility: hidden; }

	.pa-ptr.is-bad { color: var(--color-accent-700); }
	.pa-ptr.is-bad .pa-ptr-name { background: var(--color-accent-100); color: var(--color-accent-800); }

	.pa-mem {
		display: flex;
		gap: var(--pa-gap);
		width: max-content;
	}

	.pa-cell {
		width: var(--pa-cell);
		flex: none;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-1);
		padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-1);
		border: 2px solid var(--color-accent-2-300);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		background: var(--color-bg);
		transition: background 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.pa-cell-name {
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 65%, transparent);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.pa-cell-val {
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		min-height: 1.4rem;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.pa-cell-addr {
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		color: var(--color-accent-2-700);
	}

	.pa-cell.is-ghost {
		border-style: dashed;
		border-color: var(--color-divider);
		background: transparent;
	}

	.pa-cell.is-hot { border-color: var(--color-accent-2); background: var(--color-accent-2-100); }
	.pa-cell.is-bad { border-color: var(--color-accent); background: var(--color-accent-100); }
	.pa-cell.is-changed { animation: paPulse 0.7s ease-out; }

	@keyframes paPulse {
		0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 55%, transparent); }
		100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 0%, transparent); }
	}

	.pa-vars {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: var(--space-2);
		min-height: 1.8rem;
	}

	.pa-var {
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--color-neutral-100);
		color: var(--color-neutral-800);
	}

	.pa-var.is-changed { animation: paPulse 0.7s ease-out; }

	.pa-note {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 55%, transparent);
	}

	/* — step control (learn) — */
	.pa-stepbar {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-3);
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		margin-top: var(--space-4);
	}

	.pa-step-count {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 60%, transparent);
	}

	.pa-explain {
		margin: var(--space-3) 0 0;
		padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		background: var(--color-accent-2-100);
		color: var(--color-neutral-900);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		max-width: 80ch;
	}

	/* — options (practice and assess) — */
	.pa-opts {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: var(--space-2);
		margin-top: var(--space-4);
	}

	.pa-opt {
		font-family: monospace;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		text-align: left;
		padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
		border: 2px solid var(--color-divider);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		background: var(--color-bg);
		color: var(--color-text);
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
	}

	.pa-opt:hover:not(:disabled) { border-color: var(--color-accent); }
	.pa-opt:active:not(:disabled) { background: var(--color-accent-100); }
	.pa-opt:disabled { cursor: default; }
	.pa-opt:disabled:not(.is-right):not(.is-wrong) { opacity: 0.45; }
	.pa-opt[aria-pressed="true"] { border-color: var(--color-accent); background: var(--color-accent-100); }
	.pa-opt.is-right { border-color: var(--color-accent-2); background: var(--color-accent-2-100); }
	.pa-opt.is-wrong { border-color: var(--color-accent); background: var(--color-accent-100); }

	.pa-feedback {
		margin: var(--space-3) 0 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		max-width: 80ch;
		min-height: 1.5em;
	}

	.pa-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: var(--space-2);
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
	}

	.pa-assess-code { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }

	.pa-score {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight);
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-2);
		min-height: 1.5em;
	}

	.pa-results {
		margin: 0;
		padding-left: var(--space-6);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-3);
	}

	.pa-results li { line-height: 1.55; max-width: 80ch; }
	.pa-results .tag { margin-right: var(--space-2); }
	.pa-results code { font-family: monospace; }

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.pa-screen { --pa-cell: 4.4rem; }
		.pa-nav { padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4); }
		.pa-slide { padding: var(--space-4); }
		.pa-card { padding: var(--space-4); }
		.pa-title { font-size: 1.35rem; }
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.pa-ptr, .pa-line, .pa-cell { transition: none; }
		.pa-slide.is-active, .pa-ptr, .pa-cell.is-changed, .pa-var.is-changed { animation: none; }
	}
</style>

<script>
	type Txt = string | { es: string; en: string };
	type Code = string[] | { es: string[]; en: string[] };
	type Cell = { addr: string; name: string; val: string; ghost?: boolean };
	type Ptr = { n: string; i: number; bad?: boolean };
	type State = {
		code?: number;
		line: number;
		mem: Cell[];
		ptrs?: Ptr[];
		vars?: [string, string][];
		hot?: number[];
		bad?: number[];
		text?: Txt;
	};
	type Lab = {
		code: HTMLElement;
		ptrs: HTMLElement;
		mem: HTMLElement;
		vars: HTMLElement;
		markers: Map<string, HTMLElement>;
		shownCode: string[] | null;
		prevVals: Map<string, string>;
		prevVars: Map<string, string>;
	};
	type Option = { t: Txt; ok?: boolean; why: Txt };
	type PracticeItem = { codes: Code[]; q: Txt; before: State; after: State; options: Option[] };
	type AssessItem = { code: Code; q: Txt; options: Txt[]; answer: number; why: Txt };

	const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.pa-screen');
	const isEs = root?.dataset.lang !== 'en';
	const tr = (es: string, en: string) => (isEs ? es : en);
	const txt = (v: Txt | undefined) => (v === undefined ? '' : typeof v === 'string' ? v : isEs ? v.es : v.en);
	const codeOf = (c: Code) => (Array.isArray(c) ? c : isEs ? c.es : c.en);

	// ───────── memory helpers (illustrative addresses) ─────────
	const hex = (n: number) => '0x' + n.toString(16).toUpperCase().padStart(4, '0');
	const arr = (name: string, base: number, size: number, values: (number | string)[]): Cell[] =>
		values.map((v, i) => ({ addr: hex(base + i * size), name: `${name}[${i}]`, val: String(v) }));
	const ghost = (addr: number, name: string): Cell => ({ addr: hex(addr), name, val: '', ghost: true });
	const cell = (addr: number, name: string, val: string | number): Cell => ({ addr: hex(addr), name, val: String(val) });
	const chars = (name: string, word: string): Cell[] =>
		[...word.split(''), '\\0'].map((ch, i) => ({ addr: hex(0x2000 + i), name: `${name}[${i}]`, val: `'${ch}'` }));

	const ARROW =
		'<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"/></svg>';

	function el<K extends keyof HTMLElementTagNameMap>(tag: K, cls?: string, text?: string) {
		const node = document.createElement(tag);
		if (cls) node.className = cls;
		if (text !== undefined) node.textContent = text;
		return node;
	}

	function buildLab(host: HTMLElement): Lab {
		const wrap = el('div', 'pa-lab');
		const code = el('pre', 'pa-code');
		const machine = el('div', 'pa-machine');
		const track = el('div', 'pa-track');
		const ptrs = el('div', 'pa-ptrs');
		const mem = el('div', 'pa-mem');
		const vars = el('div', 'pa-vars');
		const note = el('p', 'pa-note', tr('Las direcciones son ilustrativas: int de 4 bytes y punteros de 8 bytes.', 'Addresses are illustrative: 4-byte int and 8-byte pointers.'));
		track.setAttribute('role', 'img');
		track.setAttribute('aria-label', tr('Memoria: celdas con nombre, valor y dirección', 'Memory: cells with name, value and address'));
		track.append(ptrs, mem);
		machine.append(track, vars, note);
		wrap.append(code, machine);
		host.replaceChildren(wrap);
		return { code, ptrs, mem, vars, markers: new Map(), shownCode: null, prevVals: new Map(), prevVars: new Map() };
	}

	function render(lab: Lab, state: State, codes: Code[]) {
		const lines = codeOf(codes[state.code ?? 0]);
		if (lab.shownCode !== lines) {
			lab.code.replaceChildren(
				...lines.map((line, i) => {
					const span = el('span', 'pa-line');
					span.append(el('span', 'pa-line-no', String(i + 1)), document.createTextNode(line));
					return span;
				}),
			);
			lab.shownCode = lines;
			lab.markers.forEach((m) => m.remove());
			lab.markers.clear();
			lab.prevVals.clear();
			lab.prevVars.clear();
		}
		lab.code.querySelectorAll('.pa-line').forEach((line, i) => line.classList.toggle('is-current', i + 1 === state.line));

		// memory cells
		const nextVals = new Map<string, string>();
		lab.mem.replaceChildren(
			...state.mem.map((c, i) => {
				const node = el('div', 'pa-cell');
				if (c.ghost) node.classList.add('is-ghost');
				if (state.hot?.includes(i)) node.classList.add('is-hot');
				if (state.bad?.includes(i)) node.classList.add('is-bad');
				const before = lab.prevVals.get(c.addr + c.name);
				if (before !== undefined && before !== c.val) node.classList.add('is-changed');
				nextVals.set(c.addr + c.name, c.val);
				node.append(el('span', 'pa-cell-name', c.name), el('span', 'pa-cell-val', c.val), el('span', 'pa-cell-addr', c.addr));
				return node;
			}),
		);
		lab.prevVals = nextVals;
		lab.ptrs.style.setProperty('--n', String(state.mem.length));

		// pointer markers, keyed by name so a moving pointer slides to its new cell
		const rowsAt = new Map<number, number>();
		const alive = new Set<string>();
		let maxRows = 1;
		for (const p of state.ptrs ?? []) {
			const row = rowsAt.get(p.i) ?? 0;
			rowsAt.set(p.i, row + 1);
			maxRows = Math.max(maxRows, row + 1);
			let marker = lab.markers.get(p.n);
			if (!marker) {
				marker = el('div', 'pa-ptr');
				const name = el('span', 'pa-ptr-name', p.n);
				marker.append(name);
				marker.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend', ARROW);
				lab.ptrs.append(marker);
				lab.markers.set(p.n, marker);
			}
			marker.style.setProperty('--i', String(p.i));
			marker.style.setProperty('--row', String(row));
			marker.dataset.row = String(row);
			marker.classList.toggle('is-bad', Boolean(p.bad));
			alive.add(p.n);
		}
		lab.markers.forEach((m, name) => {
			if (!alive.has(name)) {
				m.remove();
				lab.markers.delete(name);
			}
		});
		lab.ptrs.style.setProperty('--rows', String(maxRows));

		// scalar variables
		const nextVars = new Map<string, string>();
		lab.vars.replaceChildren(
			...(state.vars ?? []).map(([name, val]) => {
				const chip = el('span', 'pa-var', `${name} = ${val}`);
				const before = lab.prevVars.get(name);
				if (before !== undefined && before !== val) chip.classList.add('is-changed');
				nextVars.set(name, val);
				return chip;
			}),
		);
		lab.prevVars = nextVars;
	}

	// ───────── Learn data ─────────
	const A4 = arr('a', 0x1000, 4, [10, 20, 30, 40]);
	const V5 = arr('v', 0x1000, 4, [2, 4, 6, 8, 10]);
	const notasName = tr('notas', 'grades');
	const N5 = arr(notasName, 0x1000, 4, [7, 4, 9, 6, 8]);
	const V6 = [...arr('v', 0x1000, 4, [5, 8, 3, 9, 1, 7]), ghost(0x1018, 'v + 6')];
	const A3 = [ghost(0x0ffc, 'a - 1'), ...arr('a', 0x1000, 4, [1, 2, 3]), ghost(0x100c, 'a + 3')];
	const word = tr('hola', 'hello');
	const wordName = tr('saludo', 'greeting');
	const S = chars(wordName, word);
	const len = word.length;
	const pt = (x: number, y: number) => [cell(0x3000, 'a.x', x), cell(0x3004, 'a.y', y)];
	const fnA = tr('sumar', 'add');
	const fnB = tr('restar', 'subtract');

	const learn: { codes: Code[]; steps: State[] }[] = [
		{
			codes: [
				[
					'int a[4] = {10, 20, 30, 40};',
					'int *p = &a[0];',
					'int *q = p + 1;',
					'int *r = p + 3;',
					'printf("%td\\n", (char *)r - (char *)p);   /* 12 */',
				],
			],
			steps: [
				{ line: 1, mem: A4, text: { es: 'Los cuatro int quedan contiguos, uno pegado al otro. Cada uno ocupa sizeof(int) = 4 bytes, por eso las direcciones avanzan de 4 en 4.', en: 'The four ints sit contiguously, one right after the other. Each takes sizeof(int) = 4 bytes, so the addresses go up 4 at a time.' } },
				{ line: 2, mem: A4, ptrs: [{ n: 'p', i: 0 }], vars: [['p', '0x1000']], hot: [0], text: { es: 'p guarda la dirección del primer elemento, 0x1000. *p vale 10.', en: 'p holds the address of the first element, 0x1000. *p is 10.' } },
				{ line: 3, mem: A4, ptrs: [{ n: 'p', i: 0 }, { n: 'q', i: 1 }], vars: [['p', '0x1000'], ['q', '0x1004']], hot: [1], text: { es: 'p + 1 avanza un elemento, no un byte: 0x1000 + 1 * 4 = 0x1004, la dirección de a[1].', en: 'p + 1 moves one element, not one byte: 0x1000 + 1 * 4 = 0x1004, the address of a[1].' } },
				{ line: 4, mem: A4, ptrs: [{ n: 'p', i: 0 }, { n: 'q', i: 1 }, { n: 'r', i: 3 }], vars: [['p', '0x1000'], ['q', '0x1004'], ['r', '0x100C']], hot: [3], text: { es: 'p + 3 avanza 3 * sizeof(int) = 12 bytes: 0x100C. El compilador hace la multiplicación por ti porque conoce el tipo apuntado.', en: 'p + 3 moves 3 * sizeof(int) = 12 bytes: 0x100C. The compiler does the multiplication for you because it knows the pointed-to type.' } },
				{ line: 5, mem: A4, ptrs: [{ n: 'p', i: 0 }, { n: 'q', i: 1 }, { n: 'r', i: 3 }], vars: [['p', '0x1000'], ['r', '0x100C'], ['bytes', '12']], text: { es: 'Convertidos a char *, que ocupa 1 byte, la distancia se mide en bytes: 12. Con double serían 24, porque cada elemento ocupa 8.', en: 'Converted to char *, which takes 1 byte, the distance is measured in bytes: 12. With double it would be 24, because each element takes 8.' } },
			],
		},
		{
			codes: [['int v[5] = {2, 4, 6, 8, 10};', 'int *p = v + 1;', 'int x = *p + 1;', 'int y = *(p + 1);', 'int z = p[2];', 'p += 3;', 'int w = *p;']],
			steps: [
				{ line: 1, mem: V5, text: { es: 'v ocupa cinco celdas contiguas. En casi cualquier expresión, el nombre v se convierte en un puntero a su primer elemento: vale lo mismo que &v[0].', en: 'v takes five contiguous cells. In almost any expression, the name v turns into a pointer to its first element: it is the same value as &v[0].' } },
				{ line: 2, mem: V5, ptrs: [{ n: 'p', i: 1 }], vars: [['p', '0x1004']], hot: [1], text: { es: 'v + 1 combina las dos ideas: v decae a 0x1000 y + 1 avanza un elemento. p apunta a v[1], que vale 4.', en: 'v + 1 combines both ideas: v decays to 0x1000 and + 1 moves one element. p points to v[1], which holds 4.' } },
				{ line: 3, mem: V5, ptrs: [{ n: 'p', i: 1 }], vars: [['p', '0x1004'], ['x', '5']], hot: [1], text: { es: 'El * se aplica antes que el +: *p vale 4 y se le suma 1. x vale 5 y p no se movió.', en: 'The * applies before the +: *p is 4 and 1 is added. x is 5 and p did not move.' } },
				{ line: 4, mem: V5, ptrs: [{ n: 'p', i: 1 }], vars: [['x', '5'], ['y', '6']], hot: [2], text: { es: 'Los paréntesis cambian todo: *(p + 1) primero avanza a v[2] y después lee. y vale 6.', en: 'Parentheses change everything: *(p + 1) first moves to v[2] and then reads. y is 6.' } },
				{ line: 5, mem: V5, ptrs: [{ n: 'p', i: 1 }], vars: [['x', '5'], ['y', '6'], ['z', '8']], hot: [3], text: { es: 'p[2] es *(p + 2): v[3], que vale 8. El operador [] está definido así; por eso a[i] == *(a + i) y por eso los índices empiezan en 0.', en: 'p[2] is *(p + 2): v[3], which holds 8. The [] operator is defined that way; that is why a[i] == *(a + i) and why indexes start at 0.' } },
				{ line: 6, mem: V5, ptrs: [{ n: 'p', i: 4 }], vars: [['p', '0x1010'], ['z', '8']], hot: [4], text: { es: 'p += 3 mueve p de v[1] a v[4]: 3 * 4 = 12 bytes, de 0x1004 a 0x1010.', en: 'p += 3 moves p from v[1] to v[4]: 3 * 4 = 12 bytes, from 0x1004 to 0x1010.' } },
				{ line: 7, mem: V5, ptrs: [{ n: 'p', i: 4 }], vars: [['x', '5'], ['y', '6'], ['z', '8'], ['w', '10']], hot: [4], text: { es: 'w lee lo que hay en v[4]: 10. El arreglo nunca cambió; solo se movió el puntero.', en: 'w reads what is in v[4]: 10. The array never changed; only the pointer moved.' } },
			],
		},
		{
			codes: [
				{
					es: ['#include <stddef.h>', '#include <stdio.h>', '', 'double promedio(const int *v, size_t n) {', '    int suma = 0;', '    for (size_t i = 0; i < n; i++) {', '        suma += v[i];', '    }', '    return n > 0 ? (double)suma / (double)n : 0.0;', '}', '', 'int main(void) {', '    int notas[] = {7, 4, 9, 6, 8};', '    size_t n = sizeof notas / sizeof notas[0];', '    printf("promedio = %.2f\\n", promedio(notas, n));', '    return 0;', '}'],
					en: ['#include <stddef.h>', '#include <stdio.h>', '', 'double average(const int *v, size_t n) {', '    int sum = 0;', '    for (size_t i = 0; i < n; i++) {', '        sum += v[i];', '    }', '    return n > 0 ? (double)sum / (double)n : 0.0;', '}', '', 'int main(void) {', '    int grades[] = {7, 4, 9, 6, 8};', '    size_t n = sizeof grades / sizeof grades[0];', '    printf("average = %.2f\\n", average(grades, n));', '    return 0;', '}'],
				},
			],
			steps: [
				{ line: 13, mem: N5, vars: [[`sizeof ${notasName}`, '20']], text: { es: 'Aquí notas es un arreglo de verdad: sizeof mide los cinco int completos, 5 * 4 = 20 bytes.', en: 'Here grades is a real array: sizeof measures all five ints, 5 * 4 = 20 bytes.' } },
				{ line: 14, mem: N5, vars: [[`sizeof ${notasName}`, '20'], ['n', '5']], text: { es: 'sizeof notas / sizeof notas[0] = 20 / 4 = 5 elementos. Este cálculo solo funciona donde se declaró el arreglo.', en: 'sizeof grades / sizeof grades[0] = 20 / 4 = 5 elements. This calculation only works where the array was declared.' } },
				{ line: 15, mem: N5, ptrs: [{ n: 'v', i: 0 }], vars: [['v', '0x1000'], ['n', '5']], text: { es: 'En la llamada promedio(notas, n), notas decae a puntero: al parámetro v se copia la dirección 0x1000, no los cinco int.', en: 'In the call average(grades, n), grades decays to a pointer: the parameter v receives a copy of the address 0x1000, not the five ints.' } },
				{ line: 4, mem: N5, ptrs: [{ n: 'v', i: 0 }], vars: [['v', '0x1000'], ['n', '5'], ['sizeof v', '8']], text: { es: 'Dentro de promedio, v es un puntero: sizeof v es el tamaño de un puntero (8 en este ejemplo), no 20. La función no puede saber cuántos elementos hay; por eso n viaja aparte, como size_t.', en: 'Inside average, v is a pointer: sizeof v is the size of a pointer (8 in this example), not 20. The function cannot know how many elements there are; that is why n travels separately, as a size_t.' } },
				{ line: 7, mem: N5, ptrs: [{ n: 'v', i: 0 }], vars: [['v', '0x1000'], [tr('suma', 'sum'), '34']], hot: [0, 1, 2, 3, 4], text: { es: 'v[i] es *(v + i): la función recorre los elementos originales a través de la dirección. Con const promete no modificarlos.', en: 'v[i] is *(v + i): the function walks the original elements through the address. With const it promises not to modify them.' } },
				{ line: 15, mem: N5, vars: [[tr('promedio', 'average'), '6.80']], text: { es: 'promedio devuelve 34 / 5 = 6.80. Las declaraciones const int v[] y const int *v son equivalentes: en los dos casos llega un puntero.', en: 'average returns 34 / 5 = 6.80. The declarations const int v[] and const int *v are equivalent: in both cases a pointer arrives.' } },
			],
		},
		{
			codes: [
